values ('b0c1d2e3-4f5a-4b78-9d78-8e9f0a1b2c58', 'vector-graphics-illustrator', 'Vector Graphics (Illustrator)', 'Students understand vector graphics as scalable, editable systems for identity, illustration, icons, diagrams, packaging, and digital products, and set up Illustrator files with measurement, alignment, artboard, and grid discipline. They build clean forms and Bezier paths, use appearance and color systems, integrate type, and design icons, logos, illustrations, patterns, and modular systems, then cover cross-app handoff, print and SVG output, critique and inclusive symbols, and a polished vector capstone.');

