uction notes"}], "description": "Students learn to prepare vector files for reliable reproduction."}, {"id": "c0c815d8-0f6f-43b1-88ee-a4790145b6ba", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Digital and SVG output", "children": [{"id": "a779721f-9c25-4da0-9c3b-aa6af2dd19eb", "type": "concept", "title": "SVG, PNG, PDF, EPS, AI, asset export, artboard export, responsive variants, and retina assets"}, {"id": "84953927-d07a-43da-a719-6ed4c9a6163e", "type": "concept", "title": "SVG cleanup, IDs, CSS styling awareness, accessibility labels, and file-size optimization"}, {"id": "15594f8e-98e9-4d39-a88e-6bc20841ac91", "type": "concept", "title": "Testing exports in browsers, design systems, and real presentation contexts"}], "description": "Vector assets often need to perform in web, app, and responsive contexts."}, {"id": "fe523459-f80c-434b-b121-4bb1b5113ddf", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Quality control", "children": [{"id": "83e84d5b-9f9a-49d9-9943-25c10db7e6e7", "type": "concept", "title": "Spelling, alignment, color, missing fonts, broken links, stray points, invisible objects, and wrong artboards"}, {"id": "517ab279-0684-4e5e-b04c-67ad6ad28eb9", "type": "concept", "title": "Small-size tests, black-and-white tests, contrast checks, and export comparison"}, {"id": "a7f820c1-1e03-49b2-9c05-e9709d3191e9", "type": "concept", "title": "Deliverable folders, source logs, usage rights, and final naming conventions"}], "description": "Delivery is complete only when the file passes close inspection."}]}, {"id": "badde0da-c768-442e-950b-2f62d25243c7", "type": "topic", "title": "Critique, Ethics, Copyright, Inclusive Symbols, and Portfolio Process", "description": "Use critique, rights awareness, inclusive visual language, and documentation to strengthen design judgment.", "children": [{"id": "edbfc15f-9362-49be-a11d-9c348a19eb7b", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Critique and revision", "children": [{"id": "a392e8d6-d798-4168-b05f-150a5a1e0a45", "type": "concept", "title": "Descriptive, analy